person.note:
U. S. A., Commanding General, United States Forces, European Theater;
                    Commander in Chief, United States Forces of Occupation in Germany; also (to July
                    14) Supreme Commander, Allied Expeditionary Force.

National Leader (Reichsleiter) and Head of the
                    Office of Foreign Affairs, National Socialist German Workers Party, 1933–1940;
                    German Minister for the Occupied Eastern Territories, 1941–1944.
